    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n• Spacious and well-maintained 3 bed 3 storey house\n• Energy rating B - qualifies for low green mortgage rate\n• Upgraded quality tiled floor throughout ground floor\n• Private rear garden with decking area\n• Communal parking to the front\n• Pyrite free cert available\n• Main bedroom with built in wardrobes and ensuite\n• Living room with sliding doors access to the rear\n• Kitchen dining area to the front with modern kitchen\n• Gas central heating & double glazed window\n• Close to Castlemill S.C and the new link road to Naul Road\n• Mins drive to M1 motorway with easy access to Dublin Airport and city\n\n13 Moylaragh Way is a spacious and well-maintained three-bedroom, three-storey family home, ideally positioned within this popular residential development in Balbriggan. Offering bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout, this attractive property is perfectly suited to first-time buyers, growing families or those seeking a home in a convenient and well-connected location.\nThe ground floor features a modern fitted kitchen and dining area to the front of the property, creating an ideal space for everyday family life. To the rear, the generously proportioned living room enjoys an abundance of natural light and benefits from sliding patio doors opening directly onto the private rear garden, complete with a decking area that is perfect for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing.\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully arranged over three floors, providing excellent flexibility and privacy. The spacious main bedroom benefits from built-in wardrobes and a contemporary ensuite bathroom, while the remaining bedrooms are generously sized and well presented. The property further benefits from gas-fired central heating, double-glazed windows and the added reassurance of a pyrite-free certificate.\nOutside, there is communal parking to the front, while the private rear garden offers a secure and low-maintenance outdoor space. Ideally located just moments from Castlemill Shopping Centre and the new link road to Naul Road, the property also enjoys excellent transport connections, with the M1 motorway only a short drive away, providing swift access to Dublin Airport, Dublin City Centre and beyond. This is an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious, move-in-ready home in a highly convenient and sought-after location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 1.81m x 6.05m\nwith tiled flooring and guest wc\n\nGuest wc - 0.85m x 1.86m\nwith tiled flooring and wc with whb\n\nKitchen - 2.70m x 5.14m\nwith tiled flooring, bay window, modern kitchen units and countertop, built in hob, oven and extractor fan, plumbed for washing machine.\n\nLiving Room - 3.99m x 4.54m\nwith tiled flooring, feature fireplace with insert, sliding doors to rear\n\nLanding - 1.99n x 3.89m\nwith hotpress and stairs to 2nd floor\n\nPrimary Bedroom - 3.99m x 3.23m\nwith built in wardrobes and ensuite shower room\n\nEnsuite - 1.89m x 1.34m\nwith tiled flooring and wc whb and shower unit.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.99m x 2.41m\nwith built in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 3.99m x 2.41m\nwith tiled flooring and behind bath\n\nThird Room - 3.04m x 6.35m\nwith velux window, eave storage.\n\n"
      },
